# PolyMesh — GitIgnore

# Governance — only exists in authorized local clones
AGENTS.md

# Specifications, roadmaps, build prompts — proprietary/internal, not for public distribution
*SPEC*.md
*spec*.md
*ROADMAP*.md
*roadmap*.md
*WHAT-NEXT*.md
*what-next*.md
*prompt*.md
*REVIEW*.md
*review*.md
*.err
GROK-*.md
.v6-rewrite/
*.log
*.tmp
build/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Node
node_modules/
dist/

# TypeScript package builds belong in each package's dist/ directory. These
# patterns catch accidental source-tree emissions from an incorrectly scoped
# compiler invocation.
/packages/*/src/*.js
/packages/*/src/*.d.ts
/packages/*/src/*.js.map
/packages/*/src/*.d.ts.map

# Environment
.env
.env.local
